  "body": "## IMPORTANT: Upgrade to this release if you are using spl-stake-pool\r\n\r\nThis release contains an important bug fix and caps the maximum withdrawal fee increase to 50 basis points. See commits:\r\n\r\n* https://github.com/solana-program/stake-pool/commit/ae43045878ba4ba294c89f9ff30f080b60ea53a2: fix fee update check\r\n* https://github.com/solana-program/stake-pool/commit/54cdceda5d77b06ea7cea6e18c99560212755ab1: cap fee increase\r\n\r\nIf you are maintaining a deployment of spl-stake-pool, please update to this release.\r\n\r\n### Verifiable build\r\n\r\nTo verify the build, you must run the following steps using the `solana-verify` tool from this commit:\r\n\r\n```\r\nsolana-verify build --library-name spl_stake_pool\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis should give you the build hash of `8df58bc9f9428c02bf34fa845ae2961274156e7ff07a8dc1be0018dd765baeff`"
